        <button type="button" class="usm-btn" onclick="usmLoadExample('usmWhitelistText', 'usmWhitelistExample')">Load example whitelist</button>
        <em>Replaces the text above with a starting-point set of safe, read-only commands
        (below) &mdash; review and adjust for your own setup, then click Save settings to
