    </p>
    <pre id="usmWhitelistExample" style="display:none">^uptime$
^df -h$
^free -h$
^docker ps$
^docker ps -a$
^docker logs --tail 200 [a-zA-Z0-9_.-]+$
^docker stats --no-stream$
^docker inspect [a-zA-Z0-9_.-]+$
^cat /proc/mdstat$
^mdcmd status$
^ls -la /mnt/user$
